# Terraform working files and state (state lives in S3; bootstrap state stays local)
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfplan
tfplan
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
# Keep .terraform.lock.hcl committed (pins provider versions)

# Files moved aside during clean-up (safe to delete)
_to_delete/

# Personal values (e.g. Owner email) stay out of the public repo
*.auto.tfvars
!*.auto.tfvars.example
